; WHO 13 gateway clock: date/time writes, reads and malformed T (time zone) fields.
;
; Grammar (Encyclopedia functional/who-13-integration-gateway/dimensions.md):
;   DIMENSION 0   time      *#13**#0*H*M*S*T##
;   DIMENSION 1   date      *#13**#1*W*D*M*Y##
;   DIMENSION 22  date+time *#13**#22*H*M*S*T*W*D*M*Y##
; T is a sign digit (0 = +, 1 = -) followed by a two-digit hour offset, so
; only whole-hour offsets are expressible. OWNd 2.0.0b11 rejects non-hour
; offsets client-side; this suite asks what the firmware does with them.
;
; Fixed values: Wednesday (W=03) 21 October 2026, 14:30:00. Every step runs
; on a freshly started gateway (reset=each), so no write influences a read
; here; who13-clock-readback.seq covers write-then-read.

; --- reads ---------------------------------------------------------------
down *#13**0##
down *#13**1##
down *#13**22##

; --- DIMENSION 0 (time + zone) writes: valid whole-hour T ----------------
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*000##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*001##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*002##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*102##

; --- DIMENSION 1 (date) write ---------------------------------------------
; The date is deliberately NOT the 21 October 2026 above. The emulated gateway
; keeps the host's wall clock and echoes a DIMENSION 1 write only when it
; changes the date: writing today's date gets no output. 21 October 2026 was
; "today" when this row was first recorded (silent), so it turned into an
; echo on a later day. A date in the past (Thursday, W=04, 25 December 2025)
; can never be today again; findings/who13-clock.md has the experiment.
down *#13**#1*04*25*12*2025##

; --- DIMENSION 22 (time + zone + date) writes: valid whole-hour T --------
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*000*03*21*10*2026##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*001*03*21*10*2026##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*002*03*21*10*2026##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*102*03*21*10*2026##

; --- T edge cases ---------------------------------------------------------
; 999: what a live F461 2.0.11 answers to *#13**0##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*999##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*999*03*21*10*2026##
; empty T: frame seen in MyHOME's F461 live trace
down *#13**#0*22*50*00*##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00**03*21*10*2026##
; out of range: +24 h, -13 h, and a 4-digit +05:30 (Asia/Kolkata)
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*124##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*013##
down *#13**#0*14*30*00*0530##
down *#13**#22*14*30*00*0530*03*21*10*2026##
